<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's NAL Bank half-year profit rises.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's NAL Bank half-year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year result for Nigeria's NAL Merchant Bank to end-September 1996.</p>
<p>				(In million naira)</p>
<p>				 1996	  1995</p>
<p>Gross income		 720.2  vs   581.6</p>
<p>Profit before taxation   114.8  vs   101.7</p>
<p>Taxation			19.5  vs    17.8</p>
<p>Profit after taxation     95.3  vs    83.9</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
